      ],
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Meaning\n\nThe authoring and review convention for this library. Encoding: an ordinary graph, not a new runtime node type. It defines the form of a language contract without making the current implementation the definition of the language."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "receivesViewContent": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "primitive-specification",
          "nodeId": "specification-meaning"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "specification-invariants",
      "label": "Invariants",
      "type": "content",
      "position": {
        "x": 120,
        "y": -440
      },
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 660,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270,
          "metadata": {
            "interface": true,
            "structural": true,
            "role": "view.content"
          }
        }
      ],
      "handles": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270,
          "metadata": {
            "interface": true,
            "structural": true,
            "role": "view.content"
          },
          "portId": "root"
        }
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "type": "any"
        }
      ],
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Invariants\n\nEvery entry contains Meaning, Invariants, Contract, Ports and Relationships, Behavior, Representations, Explicitly Not Part of This Primitive, and Examples. Keep a section even when its answer is that no independent behavior exists. Preserve semantic IDs and durable addresses. Classify semantic responsibility independently from node, edge, chain or composed-graph encoding."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "receivesViewContent": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "primitive-specification",
          "nodeId": "specification-invariants"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "specification-contract",
      "label": "Contract",
      "type": "content",
      "position": {
        "x": -1000,
        "y": 300
      },
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 660,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270,
          "metadata": {
            "interface": true,
            "structural": true,
            "role": "view.content"
          }
        }
      ],
      "handles": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270,
          "metadata": {
            "interface": true,
            "structural": true,
            "role": "view.content"
          },
          "portId": "root"
        }
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "type": "any"
        }
      ],
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Contract\n\nMeaning states semantic responsibility and encoding. Invariants state agreed constraints. Contract names authored data without inventing runtime fields. Ports describes relationships. Behavior separates implemented evidence, known gaps and open decisions. Representations describes how it is shown. Boundary excludes nearby meanings. Examples link real graph artifacts through Portals."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "receivesViewContent": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "primitive-specification",
          "nodeId": "specification-contract"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "specification-ports",
      "label": "Ports and Relationships",
      "type": "content",
      "position": {
        "x": 120,
        "y": 300
      },
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 660,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
