      ],
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Behavior\n\n## Implemented behavior\n\nThe library checker validates graph structure in load/mutation modes with locally loaded edge classes, eight sections, source/test paths, example targets, nonoverlap and index membership. Focused behavior suites supply narrower implementation evidence.\n\n## Known gaps\n\nNo structural checker proves prose correctness, external publication, live fetching or browser behavior. Runtime gaps remain linked to tasks. Existing specs may preserve legacy graph encoding while their prose describes the new contract; do not bulk-normalize them.\n\n## Open decisions\n\nNo additional decision is required to describe the behavior above. Changes to that contract require an explicit task; implementation gaps are not implied approvals.\n\n## Evidence\n\nSource (twilite repository):\n- `components/GraphEditor/validators/validateGraphInvariants.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/surfaceChains.js`\n\nFocused tests (twilite repository):\n- `tests/primitiveLibrary.test.js`\n\nThese pointers identify evidence to inspect. Structural validation does not prove runtime or browser behavior."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "receivesViewContent": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "primitive-specification",
          "nodeId": "specification-behavior"
        }
      }
    },
    {
