        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Specification Form\n\nThe authoring and review convention for this library. Encoding: an ordinary graph, not a new runtime node type. It defines the form of a language contract without making the current implementation the definition of the language.\n\nOpen this graph to read its eight specification sections and follow its example Portals."
